SNABANK V1.1 - READ.ME file
----------------------------

Welcome to my Home Accounts V1.0 for the Siena.

This file is for new users only, users upgrading from V1.0 should read README.V10 and previous Users of S3ABANK should read the S3ABANK.TXT file for the differences between this and S3ABANK.

The archive should contain the following files:  

\APP\SNABANK1.APP             The main program file (and only essential one)

The following optional files:

\APP\SNABANK\BANKSNA.PIC      Optional Opening Picture

\APP\SNABANK\BANKSNA.HLP      Optional Help File for Core program

\APP\SNABANK\BANKSPRT.OVL     Optional Printing Overlay (including PSIWIN)
\OPD\SNAPRINT.DYL             Optional Printing Overlay

\APP\SNABANK\BANKCFG.OVL      Optional Configuration Module

\APP\SNABANK\BANKADV1.OVL     Optional Advanced Options Module 1
\APP\SNABANK\BANKADV2.OVL     Optional Advanced Options Module 2
                                  (See later for listing of these extra options)

\APP\SNABANK\BANKORD.OVL      Optional Standing Order/Future Transaction Module
\APP\SNABANK\BANKORD.HLP            and optional Help file
\APP\SNABANK\BANKBUD.OVL      Optional Budget Categories Module
\APP\SNABANK\BANKBUD.HLP            and optional Help file
\APP\SNABANK\BANKEXP.OVL      Optional Expense Account Module
\APP\SNABANK\BANKEXP.HLP            and optional Help file
\APP\SNABANK\BANKHOU.OVL      Optional Home Inventory Module
\APP\SNABANK\BANKHOU.HLP            and optional Help file
\APP\SNABANK\BANKPET.OVL      Optional Fuel Consumption Module
\APP\SNABANK\BANKPET.HLP            and optional Help file
\APP\SNABANK\BANKPLN.OVL      Optional Financial Planner Module
\APP\SNABANK\BANKPLN.HLP            and optional Help file
\APP\SNABANK\BANKSHA.OVL      Optional Investment Tracking Module
\APP\SNABANK\BANKSHA.HLP            and optional Help file
\APP\SNABANK\BANKUTI.OVL      Optional Utilities Tracking Module
\APP\SNABANK\BANKUTI.HLP            and optional Help file

